1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,719
MEN: I can't believe this, but I managed to book a ticket to Singapore.

2
00:00:04,719 --> 00:00:08,090
I will be on the seven o'clock flight tomorrow morning.

3
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:11,445
WOMAN: That's great. Does that mean that you will get to see your friend

4
00:00:11,445 --> 00:00:15,280
who moved out there a few years back after you are finished meeting with Mr. Wang?

5
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,272
MEN: I am not sure because Mr.

6
00:00:17,272 --> 00:00:22,110
Wang will probably want to take me around the plant site on the day I arrive there.

7
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:26,060
I am hoping that I will be able to see my friend the day after,

8
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:29,220
but he mentioned that he might have to leave town that day.

9
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:32,260
He said he would try to rearrange his trip

10
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,996
but I have not spoken to him for a few days.

11
00:00:34,996 --> 00:00:39,040
I will call him tonight to see if he is able to do that.

12
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,020
WOMAN: You should just take your vacation early

13
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,080
